	"_doc": [
		"Cross-language conformance vectors for fractional indexing. This file is duplicated",
		"byte-for-byte in fuz_util (src/test/) and fuz_sys (src/) — the two implementations of",
		"the same algorithm. It is the contract that keeps them emitting identical keys.",
		"`key` / `keys` are BARE deterministic output: TS must pass {jitter: false}; Rust has",
		"no jitter layer. If a change makes one side fail, the other side is now wrong too —",
		"fix the implementation, do not edit these values. Changing them is a deliberate",
		"redefinition of the wire order and must land in both repos together."
	],
